Subject: [PATCH 03/22] dt-bindings: arm: rockchip: Add Sunniwell Z96A (Type-C
 charging)

Add compatible for the Sunniwell Z96A laptop, Type-C charging variant,
based on the Rockchip RK3568 SoC.

Signed-off-by: Jun Yan <jerrysteve1101@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/rockchip.yaml | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/rockchip.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/rockchip.yaml
index 1a9dde18626d..534fec7bc866 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/rockchip.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/rockchip.yaml
@@ -1252,6 +1252,11 @@ properties:
               - rockchip,rv1126
               - rockchip,rv1109
 
+      - description: Sunniwell Z96A (Type-C charging)
+        items:
+          - const: sunniwell,z96a-typec
+          - const: rockchip,rk3568
+
       - description: Theobroma Systems PX30-Cobra
         items:
           - enum:
